== Wrapping up ==

[[File:DQ6_Shrine_North_of_Turnscote.png|thumb|right|]]

[[File:DQ6 Path to Turnscote and Good Items.jpg|thumb|left|There's good stuff at the well!]]

[[File:DQ6 Well West of Turnscote.png|thumb|right|Try to buy two Flowing Dresses, one Thinking Cap, and one Shellmet from this place.]]

Warp back to Turnscote and get your [[File:Dragon Warrior 3 SNES Small Medal.png]] <span style="color:green">60th Mini Medal</span> at the Graveyard.  Then sail to the Well; you will find your [[File:Dragon Warrior 3 SNES Small Medal.png]] <span style="color:green">61st Mini Medal</span> here, as well as a plethora of shops selling incredible equipment.  You should be able to buy one Thinking Cap for Carver (+20 Wisdom), one Slime Helmet (40+ Defense for Nevan and Healie), and two Flowing Dresses (4th highest resistances in the game). But do not sell the Fire Claw, Bunny Ears, or Hela's Armour!

You should now have 61 Mini Medals and 9 Dreamscapes; so Zoom to Medford's Manor and get the Sacred Armour!  This here is one of the best in the game!  It regenerates 30 or 50 HP per turn (depending on the version), sports the 7th highest Resilience of any armour in the game, and even comes in handy for a future mini-game.  Mobile players can also get Curie at Suite Dreams if you wish, along with Shelley at the Undersea Inn. 

With all that said and done, your current set-up should look something like this:

